2026-10-08. Scoped verdict: preparation design coherent; **one artifact-admission correction required before declaring the driver fully ready**. No cost build/probe, benchmark, host test, source/index change or forge mutation was performed. The report reviews the Stage cost phase, not all shipping source and not an emitted-cost PASS. Applicable main `.baseline`/`.goals`, repository law, sole accepted plan native-cost clauses and retained T3 review were read.

Current candidate is prepared tree `d632307fb725304ed864967d5234cdab35bc5c99`, including the qualified lazy row protocol. Root's baseline is tracked main `2eb04d61f3d65f34ec77b396b5d03c05c23fd5ee`, archived at `/opt/purrdf-454-native-cost-main-2eb04d61`; the retained tar provenance is in `portfolio-current-native-cost-baseline.md`. Driver matches baseline OID to retained MERGE_HEAD, compares each tracked baseline blob, hashes/readbacks all tracked inputs, refuses unstaged/unresolved candidate source and checks the expected index tree. Both common probe copies must match and their generated offline locks must match. The actual common source SHA256 reread here is `aef409ac8b1122df07bab53f1053f5356decb5b3059db583013e7664bea40587`.

## Profile and claim boundaries

Actual workspace release is O3/fat-LTO/codegen1/strip-symbols, checks off. The accepted historical analytical stages are paired native O3/ThinLTO/codegen1 and paired ordinary PyO3 O3/no-LTO, both strip-symbols/checks-off/target-cpu native/warnings-denied. Driver sets those explicitly for each role, uses the same absolute active SDK and supported absolute PYO3_PYTHON, and records verbose Cargo/rustc output and selected compiler JSON artifacts. This is a legitimate reproduction of those named proof stages. It is not matched production fat-LTO emission, dev/test checks-on performance proof, or WASM cost proof. More optimization must not be presumed to erase a observed regression. Final adjudication must distinguish general source-operation arguments from the exact profiles actually inspected; an unresolved ordinary-path cost cannot be excused by the profile name.

The plan requires unchanged primary native representation/allocation/algorithmic work, not numeric tolerance or elapsed-time measurement. No timing command, host semantic oracle, second evaluator or new shipping dependency is introduced here. The scoped paired stages plus complete source/body arguments can meet that accepted analytical contract; if final source arguments cannot discharge a production-relevant seam, the missing proof is a concrete blocker rather than a silently added assumption.

## Concrete artifact-admission finding

Native emission validates paired nonempty .ll/.s counterparts and actual algebra/eval/xsd/main components. Host emission instead checks only that the selected `purrdf_native` path list has two .ll-or-.s files, then hashes them. It does not require one of each, matching stems or nonempty emitted bodies. Two .ll files or empty emitted output can therefore reach artifact-generation success, contrary to the preparation's complete-body/pair refusal contract. Reuse the native nonempty counterpart admission for this host role and explicitly require the one module pair; no generic parser/framework or shipping edit is warranted. Compiler JSON library selection (one non-test frame, exactly .so and .rlib, both nonempty) otherwise correctly refuses ambiguity.

The required final audit must read actual verbose argv and compiler identities across all four emits, not infer identical tooling merely from one initial version string or an active-toolchain path. Source manifests/profile environment and actual argv establish the settings; executable/module hashes and before/after readbacks establish the retained artifacts. The driver leaves `cost-verdict-pending.txt` deliberately. Its terminal0 means source-bound generation and probe equality, never complete native-cost acceptance.

## 32-record probe and full proof coverage

The frozen Rust probe emits one layout,13ordinary query,13request-binding,2numeric-policy and3configured-relation records:32total. Windows exercise actual parse, clone/drop, prepare/query admission, retained sizes, warmed reused execution, first-party governor vectors, named graphs, correlation/OPTIONAL/MINUS/EXISTS/LATERAL, filtering/projection/BIND/order/distinct/group and SUM/AVG (including big integers). Exact/fixed division and configured first-party property functions are included. One counting-allocator home is used; no clock exists. Complete record equality is required. Most records compare row counts, allocations/retention/resource use rather than complete value bags; independent semantic qualification already owns answers. Do not call this a comprehensive output oracle or whole-engine operation count.

Complete emitted/source proof still must name attributable baseline/candidate full bodies and callers for: ordinary parserfalse specialization; AST old arms/iterative traversal/admission/hash/clone/drop/storage; evaluator RdfDataset dispatcher and erased unit RowDelivery; Filter/Extend/Project checkpoints/buffer reuse; Group/Graph/Dedup/LATERAL/correlated substitution/property functions and erased application/domain state; exact SUM/AVG numeric recurrence/tail, count/max/carry/cost order and absence of added push/state/fast-path tests; ordinary static Python Store.query wrapper/query/detach capture/closure drop/ABI; changed row materialization and iterator storage placement. Every instruction/call/control edge/load/store/drop/alloca/frame and loop relevant to changed work must remain visible. Symbol/path/metadata normalization is acceptable; substantive operations cannot be normalized away.

The proposed seam table covers these obligations. Layout/equal allocation or small frame alone cannot show erased mode forwarding, consumer callback, extra loop, ABI argument, capture ownership/drop or numeric helper call. The new iterator legitimately adds work only when iter(row) is invoked; native query/materialization must not eagerly allocate/copy that iterator. Reuse matching historical parser/traits/numeric source arguments only after exact source-hash qualification, while rebinding changed compiler/main composition to fresh bodies. Snapshot existence alone does not qualify output.

